{
  "id": "1220",
  "title": "Four Seasons of the Year",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2023-02-22",
  "synopsis": "All four seasons of the year are a spectacle to behold, but it’s not just the seasons that are changing.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1220/99563c4ea537dc89b5a6526cc62342addad8fe03.mp3?1614335806",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "一年四季\n\n    春天来了，小草绿了，花儿开了。小鸟在树上唱歌，小朋友放风筝。\n    夏天来了，天热了，下雨了。小鱼在水中游，小朋友去划船。\n    秋天来了，叶子黄了，果子红了。鸟儿往南飞，小朋友去爬山。\n    冬天来了，天冷了，下雪了。小狗在雪里跑来跑去，小朋友去滑雪。\n    一年四季风景美，小朋友又长大了一岁。",
    "traditional": "一年四季\n\n    春天來了，小草綠了，花兒開了。小鳥在樹上唱歌，小朋友放風箏。\n    夏天來了，天熱了，下雨了。小魚在水中游，小朋友去划船。\n    秋天來了，葉子黃了，果子紅了。鳥兒往南飛，小朋友去爬山。\n    冬天來了，天冷了，下雪了。小狗在雪裡跑來跑去，小朋友去滑雪。\n    一年四季風景美，小朋友又長大了一歲。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Four Seasons of the Year"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "春天来了，小草绿了，花儿开了。",
      "traditional": "春天來了，小草綠了，花兒開了。",
      "pinyin": "chūn tiān lái le xiǎo cǎo lǜ le huā'r kāi le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "小鸟在树上唱歌，小朋友放风筝。",
      "traditional": "小鳥在樹上唱歌，小朋友放風箏。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo niǎo zài shù shang chàng gē xiǎo péng you fàng fēng zhēng",
      "english": "Spring has come, the grass has become green and the flowers have blossomed."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The birds are singing in the trees and the children are playing with kites."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "夏天来了，天热了，下雨了。",
      "traditional": "夏天來了，天熱了，下雨了。",
      "pinyin": "xià tiān lái le tiān rè le xià yǔ le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小鱼在水中游，小朋友去划船。",
      "traditional": "小魚在水中游，小朋友去划船。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yú zài shuǐ zhōng yóu xiǎo péng you qù huá chuán",
      "english": "Summer has come, the weather is hot and it has rained."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The fish are swimming in the water and the children have gone rowing."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "秋天来了，叶子黄了，果子红了。",
      "traditional": "秋天來了，葉子黃了，果子紅了。",
      "pinyin": "qiū tiān lái le yè zi huáng le guǒ zi hóng le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "鸟儿往南飞，小朋友去爬山。",
      "traditional": "鳥兒往南飛，小朋友去爬山。",
      "pinyin": "niǎo'r wǎng nán fēi xiǎo péng you qù pá shān",
      "english": "Fall has come, the leaves have turned yellow and the fruits have turned red."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The birds are flying south and the children have gone hiking."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "冬天来了，天冷了，下雪了。",
      "traditional": "冬天來了，天冷了，下雪了。",
      "pinyin": "dōng tiān lái le tiān lěng le xià xuě le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "小狗在雪里跑来跑去，小朋友去滑雪。",
      "traditional": "小狗在雪裡跑來跑去，小朋友去滑雪。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo gǒu zài xuě lǐ pǎo lái pǎo qù xiǎo péng you qù huá xuě",
      "english": "Winter has come, the days have become cold and it has snowed."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The dogs are running around in the snow and the children have gone skiing."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "一年四季风景美，小朋友又长大了一岁。",
      "traditional": "一年四季風景美，小朋友又長大了一歲。",
      "pinyin": "yì nián sì jì fēng jǐng měi xiǎo péng you yòu zhǎng dà le yí suì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The scenery is beautiful in all four seasons of the year and the children have grown one year older."
    }
  ],
